* Assigns gun times to all three races
*
*   When to use:    Just once at the starting gun (once per distance, or all here).
*   How to use:     Update the race names and gun times in setgunstart.rsm below.
*                   Each line writes the GunStart database field only -- it does
*                   not update the GunStart event by itself.
*   Alternative:    Use GunTimePromt5K.2.O.lst / GunTimePromt10K.2.O.lst /
*                   GunTimePromtHalf.2.O.lst for a dialog box (includes Continue
*                   and field -> event copy).
*
*   setgunstart.rsm lines below -- one per race distance, field values only.


setgunstart.rsm 5K 09:02:11.15
setgunstart.rsm 10K 08:31:50.84
setgunstart.rsm HALF 08:00:00.00

* GunTime2Event.rsm -- copies GunStart database field into the GunStart event.
*                     setgunstart.rsm above only writes the field; without this
*                     step the event is never updated.
GunTime2Event.rsm
